WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.800
Guile begins raw Drive Rush toward the corner.

2
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:01.350
Standing medium punch connects.

3
00:00:01.350 --> 00:00:02.100
Crouching heavy punch connects after the medium.

4
00:00:02.100 --> 00:00:03.500
The Overdrive projectile continues the juggle.

5
00:00:03.500 --> 00:00:04.800
Heavy-punch Sonic Hurricane extends the airborne sequence.

6
00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:06.250
The Super keeps the opponent in the corner juggle.

7
00:00:06.250 --> 00:00:07.000
OD Flash Kick connects after Hurricane.

8
00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:07.050
Manon falls after the OD kick as Guile lands.
